<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis Amev upgrades forecast 1996.</title>
<headline>Fortis Amev upgrades forecast 1996.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial services group Fortis said on Thursday it saw net profits per share of both parents Fortis Amev and Fortis AG up at least 10 percent for the whole of 1996 compared to 1995.</p>
</text>
